WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.536
Mandy and Jinying could not find the monkey.

2
00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:08.268
"Maybe it left the property," said Jinying.

3
00:00:08.269 --> 00:00:13.806
Outside, Mandy was amazed at Jinying’s courtyard house.

4
00:00:13.807 --> 00:00:18.497
It took up an entire block.

5
00:00:18.498 --> 00:00:24.228
"Why do you have so many little buildings?" she asked.

6
00:00:24.229 --> 00:00:28.231
"Each building has a different purpose," he replied.

7
00:00:28.232 --> 00:00:31.482
"We receive guests in the main house.

8
00:00:31.483 --> 00:00:36.013
My father and mother have their own buildings and so do I."

9
00:00:36.014 --> 00:00:39.424
They walked past Jinying’s house.

10
00:00:39.425 --> 00:00:45.480
Mandy noticed that some people wore shiny silk, like Jinying.

11
00:00:45.481 --> 00:00:50.934
But others wore dark clothes made from rough material.

12
00:00:50.935 --> 00:00:54.810
Some people on the street called out to Jinying.

13
00:00:54.811 --> 00:01:00.066
"Congratulations, Master Jinying," they said.

14
00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:04.655
Jinying nodded but kept walking.

15
00:01:04.656 --> 00:01:10.249
"There it is!" Mandy suddenly caught sight of the monkey.

16
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:14.877
It was climbing onto the roof of a strange building.

17
00:01:14.878 --> 00:01:20.485
"What a funny house," giggled Mandy.

18
00:01:20.486 --> 00:01:24.670
"Why is it built so open to the outside?"

19
00:01:24.671 --> 00:01:29.535
"It gets very hot here sometimes," replied Jinying.

20
00:01:29.536 --> 00:01:34.210
"People like to meet, relax, and keep cool in these places."

21
00:01:34.211 --> 00:01:37.550
Jinying reached into his pocket.

22
00:01:37.551 --> 00:01:40.822
He had some sunflower seeds.

23
00:01:40.823 --> 00:01:46.025
He gave them to Mandy, and she held them out to the monkey.

24
00:01:46.026 --> 00:01:50.297
It came down from the roof and sniffed her hand.

25
00:01:50.298 --> 00:01:53.212
Mandy grabbed the monkey.

26
00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:56.708
Suddenly a loud voice called out,

27
00:01:56.709 --> 00:01:58.867
"That’s my monkey!"

28
00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:00.998
It was the trainer.

29
00:02:00.999 --> 00:02:05.004
He was on a horse and waving a large stick.

30
00:02:05.005 --> 00:02:08.944
"What should we do?" Mandy asked.

31
00:02:08.945 --> 00:02:12.018
The monkey clung to her shirt.

32
00:02:12.019 --> 00:02:15.590
"Come with me." Jinying took her arm.

33
00:02:15.591 --> 00:02:17.363
"I have an idea."

34
00:02:17.364 --> 00:02:22.534
Vinnie, meanwhile, was trying to get back to the square.

35
00:02:22.535 --> 00:02:27.011
He walked to the end of a street and stared.

36
00:02:27.012 --> 00:02:28.754
"I can’t believe it!

37
00:02:28.755 --> 00:02:33.889
This whole city is surrounded by a wall," he said aloud.

38
00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:38.136
Backing away, Vinnie bumped into someone.

39
00:02:38.137 --> 00:02:41.349
They both fell to the ground.

40
00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:44.607
"I’m sorry," cried Vinnie.

41
00:02:44.608 --> 00:02:49.810
He turned and saw a bald man wearing a long robe.

42
00:02:49.811 --> 00:02:54.084
Next to him was a walking stick and book.

43
00:02:54.085 --> 00:02:57.151
"Are you hurt?" asked Vinnie.

44
00:02:57.152 --> 00:03:00.335
"I think I twisted my ankle.

45
00:03:00.336 --> 00:03:04.535
Would you mind helping me?" the man asked.

46
00:03:04.536 --> 00:03:08.612
"Of course," Vinnie replied.

47
00:03:08.613 --> 00:03:12.469
He put the man’s arm around his shoulder.

48
00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:16.073
"Where are we going?" Vinnie asked.

49
00:03:16.074 --> 00:03:21.841
"To the monastery, over there," said the man, pointing.

50
00:03:21.842 --> 00:03:28.816
On the other side of the city, Mandy and Jinying were running from the trainer.

51
00:03:28.817 --> 00:03:34.275
They tried to hide behind a wagon piled high with wheat.

52
00:03:34.276 --> 00:03:36.821
"Thieves! I see you!"

53
00:03:36.822 --> 00:03:44.643
The monkey trainer had found them.

